msgstr "사용 가능한 :ref:`OKR.BEST 구성 옵션 <integrations-guide/microsoft-calendar:enable and configure the microsoft calendar integration in mattermost>`은 :doc:`Microsoft 캘린더 통합을 OKR.BEST에 연결 </integrations-guide/microsoft-calendar>` 제품 문서를 참조하세요."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/plugins-configuration-settings.rst:1788
msgid "Microsoft Teams Meetings"
msgstr "Microsoft Teams 회의"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/plugins-configuration-settings.rst:1790
msgid ""
"See the :doc:`Connect Microsoft Teams Meetings to Mattermost "
"</integrations-guide/microsoft-teams-meetings>` product documentation for"
" available :ref:`Mattermost configuration options <integrations-guide"
"/microsoft-teams-meetings:enable and configure the microsoft teams "
"meetings integration in mattermost>`."
msgstr "사용 가능한 :ref:`OKR.BEST 구성 옵션 <integrations-guide/microsoft-teams-meetings:enable and configure the microsoft teams meetings integration in mattermost>`은 :doc:`Microsoft Teams 회의를 OKR.BEST에 연결 </integrations-guide/microsoft-teams-meetings>` 제품 문서를 참조하세요."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/plugins-configuration-settings.rst:1797
msgid "MS Teams"
msgstr "MS Teams"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/plugins-configuration-settings.rst:1799
msgid ""
"Mattermost for Microsoft Teams enables you to break through siloes in a "
"mixed Mattermost and Teams environment by forwarding real-time chat "
"notifications from Teams to Mattermost."
msgstr "Mattermost for Microsoft Teams를 사용하면 Teams의 실시간 채팅 알림을 OKR.BEST로 전달하여 OKR.BEST와 Teams가 혼합된 환경에서 사일로를 허물 수 있습니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/plugins-configuration-settings.rst:1803
msgid ""
"Download our `Mattermost for Microsoft Teams datasheet "
"<https://mattermost.com/mattermost-for-microsoft-teams-datasheet/>`_ to "
"learn how Mattermost helps your organization get more from your Microsoft"
" tools."
msgstr "OKR.BEST가 조직이 Microsoft 도구를 더 잘 활용하도록 돕는 방법을 알아보려면 `Mattermost for Microsoft Teams 데이터시트 <https://mattermost.com/mattermost-for-microsoft-teams-datasheet/>`_를 다운로드하세요."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/plugins-configuration-settings.rst:1805
msgid ""
"Access the following configuration settings in the System Console by "
"going to **Plugins > MS Teams**."
msgstr "관리자 도구에서 **Plugins > MS Teams**로 이동하여 다음 구성 설정에 접근합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/plugins-configuration-settings.rst:1820
msgid "Enable the Mattermost for Microsoft Teams plugin for all Mattermost teams."
msgstr "모든 OKR.BEST 팀에 대해 Mattermost for Microsoft Teams 플러그인을 활성화합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/plugins-configuration-settings.rst:1823
msgid "**true**: Enables MS Teams plugin on your Mattermost workspace."
msgstr "**true**: OKR.BEST 워크스페이스에서 MS Teams 플러그인을 활성화합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/plugins-configuration-settings.rst:1824
msgid "**false**: **(Default)** Disables the MS Teams plugin."
msgstr "**false**: **(기본값)** MS Teams 플러그인을 비활성화합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/plugins-configuration-settings.rst:1820
#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/plugins-configuration-settings.rst:1842
#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/plugins-configuration-settings.rst:1858
#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/plugins-configuration-settings.rst:1874
#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/plugins-configuration-settings.rst:1890
#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/plugins-configuration-settings.rst:1910
#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/plugins-configuration-settings.rst:1931
#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/plugins-configuration-settings.rst:1953
#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/plugins-configuration-settings.rst:1972
#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/plugins-configuration-settings.rst:1990
msgid "System Config path: **Plugins > MS Teams**"
msgstr "관리자 도구 경로: **Plugins > MS Teams**"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/plugins-configuration-settings.rst:1828
msgid ""
"Use the `Enabled Teams <#enabled-teams>`__ configuration option to "
"specify which Mattermost teams synchronize direct and group messages with"
" Microsoft Teams chats."
msgstr "`활성화된 팀 <#enabled-teams>`__ 구성 옵션을 사용하여 어떤 OKR.BEST 팀이 개인 메시지 및 그룹 메시지를 Microsoft Teams 채팅과 동기화할지 지정합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/plugins-configuration-settings.rst:1839
msgid "Tenant ID"
msgstr "테넌트 ID"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/plugins-configuration-settings.rst:1842
msgid "Specify the Microsoft Teams Tenant ID from the Azure portal."
msgstr "Azure 포털에서 Microsoft Teams 테넌트 ID를 지정합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/plugins-configuration-settings.rst:1855
msgid "Client ID"
msgstr "클라이언트 ID"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/plugins-configuration-settings.rst:1858
msgid ""
"Specify the Microsoft Teams Client ID of your registered OAuth app in the"
" Azure portal."
msgstr "Azure 포털에서 등록한 OAuth 앱의 Microsoft Teams 클라이언트 ID를 지정합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/plugins-configuration-settings.rst:1871
msgid "Client secret"
msgstr "클라이언트 시크릿"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/plugins-configuration-settings.rst:1874
msgid "Specify the client secret of your registered OAuth app in Azure portal."
msgstr "Azure 포털에서 등록한 OAuth 앱의 클라이언트 시크릿을 지정합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/plugins-configuration-settings.rst:1876
#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/plugins-configuration-settings.rst:1893
msgid "Alpha-numeric value."
msgstr "영숫자 값."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/plugins-configuration-settings.rst:1887
msgid "At rest encryption key"
msgstr "저장 데이터 암호화 키"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/plugins-configuration-settings.rst:1890
msgid ""
"Regenerate a new encryption secret. This encryption secret will be used "
"to encrypt and decrypt the OAuth token."
msgstr "새 암호화 시크릿을 재생성합니다. 이 암호화 시크릿은 OAuth 토큰을 암호화하고 복호화하는 데 사용됩니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/plugins-configuration-settings.rst:1897
#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/plugins-configuration-settings.rst:1916
msgid "Select **Regenerate** to generate a new key."
msgstr "새 키를 생성하려면 **Regenerate**를 선택합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/plugins-configuration-settings.rst:1907
msgid "Webhook secret"
msgstr "웹훅 시크릿"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/plugins-configuration-settings.rst:1910
msgid ""
"Generate the webhook secret that Microsoft Teams will use to send "
"messages to Mattermost."
msgstr "Microsoft Teams가 OKR.BEST로 메시지를 보내는 데 사용할 웹훅 시크릿을 생성합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/plugins-configuration-settings.rst:1928
msgid "Use the evaluation API pay model"
msgstr "평가 API 유료 모델 사용"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/plugins-configuration-settings.rst:1931
msgid ""
"Enable this only for testing purposes. You need the pay model to be able "
"to support enough message notifications to work in a real world scenario."
msgstr "테스트 목적으로만 활성화하세요. 실제 시나리오에서 작동할 만큼 충분한 메시지 알림을 지원하려면 유료 모델이 필요합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/plugins-configuration-settings.rst:1935
msgid "**true**: Enables the evaluation API pay model."
msgstr "**true**: 평가 API 유료 모델을 활성화합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/plugins-configuration-settings.rst:1936
msgid "**false**: **(Default)** Disables the evaluation API pay model."
msgstr "**false**: **(기본값)** 평가 API 유료 모델을 비활성화합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/plugins-configuration-settings.rst:1950
msgid "Sync notifications"
msgstr "알림 동기화"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/plugins-configuration-settings.rst:1953
msgid ""
"Notify connected users in Mattermost on receipt of a chat or group chat "
"from Microsoft Teams."
msgstr "Microsoft Teams로부터 채팅 또는 그룹 채팅을 수신하면 OKR.BEST의 연결된 사용자에게 알립니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/plugins-configuration-settings.rst:1956
msgid ""
"**true**: **(Default)** Sync notifications of chat messages for any "
"connected user that enables the feature."
msgstr "**true**: **(기본값)** 이 기능을 활성화한 연결된 모든 사용자에 대해 채팅 메시지 알림을 동기화합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/plugins-configuration-settings.rst:1958
msgid "**false**: Do not sync notifications."
msgstr "**false**: 알림을 동기화하지 않습니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/plugins-configuration-settings.rst:1969
msgid "Maximum size of attachments to support complete one time download"
msgstr "완전한 일회성 다운로드를 지원하기 위한 첨부 파일의 최대 크기"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/plugins-configuration-settings.rst:1972
msgid ""
"Specify the maximum file size, in mebibytes (MiB), of attachments that "
"can be loaded into memory. Attachment files larger than this value will "
"be streamed from Microsoft Teams to Mattermost."
msgstr "메모리에 로드할 수 있는 첨부 파일의 최대 파일 크기(MiB)를 지정합니다. 이 값보다 큰 첨부 파일은 Microsoft Teams에서 OKR.BEST로 스트리밍됩니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/plugins-configuration-settings.rst:1976
#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/plugins-configuration-settings.rst:1993
msgid "Numerical value. Default is **20** MiB."
msgstr "숫자 값. 기본값은 **20** MiB입니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/plugins-configuration-settings.rst:1987
msgid "Buffer size for streaming files"
msgstr "파일 스트리밍을 위한 버퍼 크기"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/plugins-configuration-settings.rst:1990
